<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 150 million Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 150 million Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    27.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.70    PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P *AA1/AA    DENOMS (K) 5</p>
<p> NOTES     *SUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
